{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08042","headline":"雉子斑 · 李白","name":"雉子斑","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"辟邪伎作鼓吹惊，雉子班之奏曲成，喔咿振迅欲飞鸣。\n扇锦翼，雄风生。\n双雌同饮啄，趫悍谁能争。\n乍向草中耿介死，不求黄金笼下生。\n天地至广大，何惜遂物情。\n善卷让天子，务光亦逃名。\n所贵旷士怀，朗然合太清。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_08042.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08042","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}